## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.1 Codex Mini
- **Short description:** A fast, efficient coding model (released 2025-11-14) optimized for quick code completion, simple refactoring and routine programming.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI API/Responses (`gpt-5.1-codex-mini`), Azure OpenAI, plus ~16 gateway routes.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2025-11-14; knowledge cutoff 2024-09-30 (models.dev).
- **IDs:** `gpt-5.1-codex-mini`, `openai/gpt-5.1-codex-mini`, `azure/gpt-5.1-codex-mini`.
- **Context window:** 400,000 total (272,000 input / 128,000 max output).
- **Modalities:** text, image and PDF in; text out; reasoning and tool calls.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11/12):** $0.25 / $2.00 per 1M input/output; cache read $0.025.
- **Architecture:** proprietary (undisclosed).

